      "writtenOn": "2010-08-18T19:09:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since you\u0027re not taking the prefix length parameter, and you already have an addDefaultRoute method, this method should be called addHostRoute. It should take interfaceName, dst, and gw.\n\nThe prefixLen parameter to addRoute should be determined by the type of dst. If dst is an IPv6 address it should be 128, and if it\u0027s an IPv4 address it should be 32. This is similar to what you do above in addDefaultRoute",
      "revId": "2987c3eecc0f72b109154c693c7ba12ac87e9a57",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
